釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":217.44,"default_fair_val":217.44,"premium_pct":-69.6,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":11,"pe_forward":9.7,"pb_trailing":7.7,"pb_forward":6.9,"div_yield":6.98,"ps_ratio":2.3,"fcf_to_ev":9.06,"fcf_to_mcap":10.96,"liab_to_assets":76.2,"cash_to_assets":7.6,"current_ratio":0.74,"roe":69.9,"roa":14.7,"moat":{"ticker":"UL","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"聯合利華擁有眾多家喻戶曉的品牌，如 Dove、Knorr、Lipton 等，這些品牌在全球消費者心中建立了深厚的信任與忠誠度。這種品牌資產賦予了公司顯著的定價權，使其能夠在不顯著損害銷量的基礎上，將成本上升轉嫁給消費者。相較於競爭對手，聯合利華的品牌組合更為多元化，涵蓋個人護理、食品和家庭護理等多個領域，降低了對單一市場的依賴。這種廣泛的品牌影響力是其核心競爭優勢，體現了巴菲特所重視的特許經營權的特徵，即消費者因品牌價值而願意支付溢價。","comment_en":"Unilever possesses numerous household names like Dove, Knorr, and Lipton, which have cultivated deep trust and loyalty among global consumers. This brand equity grants the company significant pricing power, enabling it to pass on rising costs to consumers without substantially impacting sales volume. Compared to competitors, Unilever's brand portfolio is more diversified, spanning personal care, food, and home care, reducing reliance on any single market. This extensive brand influence is a core competitive advantage, reflecting the characteristic of a franchise business that Buffett values, where consumers are willing to pay a premium for brand value."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"聯合利華的業務主要集中在消費品領域，雖然部分產品可能涉及專利技術，但其核心競爭力並非依賴於嚴格的專利保護或監管壁壘。與製藥或高科技行業不同，消費品行業的創新迭代速度快，專利保護的時效性相對較短，且容易被替代性產品或配方所繞過。因此，專利和監管壁壘對聯合利華的護城河貢獻有限，其競爭優勢更多來自於品牌、分銷和規模。","comment_en":"Unilever's business is primarily in the consumer goods sector. While some products may involve patented technologies, its core competitiveness does not rely on stringent patent protection or regulatory barriers. Unlike the pharmaceutical or high-tech industries, the consumer goods sector experiences rapid innovation cycles, and patent protection is relatively short-lived and easily circumvented by alternative products or formulations. Therefore, patent and regulatory barriers contribute limitedly to Unilever's moat; its competitive advantages stem more from branding, distribution, and scale."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"對於大多數聯合利華的日常消費品，消費者的轉換成本相對較低。消費者可以輕易地從一個品牌的肥皂、洗髮水或食品轉換到另一個品牌，尤其是在價格或促銷活動的驅動下。然而，在某些特定細分市場，例如專業護膚或特定食品口味偏好上，消費者可能存在一定的品牌忠誠度，這會產生輕微的轉換阻力。但總體而言，這種轉換成本不足以構成強大的護城河，更多依賴於持續的品牌營銷來維持客戶。","comment_en":"For most of Unilever's daily consumer products, the switching costs for consumers are relatively low. Consumers can easily switch from one brand of soap, shampoo, or food to another, especially driven by price or promotional activities. However, in certain specific niche markets, such as specialized skincare or particular food taste preferences, consumers may exhibit some brand loyalty, creating minor switching friction. Overall, these switching costs are not substantial enough to form a strong moat, relying more on continuous brand marketing to retain customers."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"聯合利華的業務模式基本上不具備顯著的網絡效應。其產品的價值和消費者的購買決策，主要基於產品本身的品質、品牌聲譽和價格，而非用戶之間的互動或網絡規模。例如，購買 Dove 肥皂的消費者數量增加，並不會直接增加其他消費者購買 Dove 肥皂的價值或意願。因此，網絡效應對聯合利華的護城河貢獻微乎其微。","comment_en":"Unilever's business model fundamentally lacks significant network effects. The value of its products and consumer purchasing decisions are primarily based on product quality, brand reputation, and price, rather than user interactions or network size. For instance, an increase in the number of consumers buying Dove soap does not directly enhance the value or willingness of other consumers to buy Dove soap. Therefore, network effects contribute minimally to Unilever's moat."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"聯合利華憑藉其龐大的全球生產和分銷網絡，實現了顯著的規模經濟效應。這使其在採購原材料、生產製造以及物流運輸方面，相較於小型競爭對手擁有顯著的成本優勢。大規模的採購量能夠獲得更優惠的價格，而優化的生產流程和分銷網絡則能降低單位生產和運輸成本。這種成本優勢不僅提高了公司的利潤率，也使其能夠在市場上提供更具競爭力的價格，鞏固其市場領導地位。","comment_en":"Leveraging its vast global production and distribution network, Unilever achieves significant economies of scale. This provides it with a substantial cost advantage over smaller competitors in raw material procurement, manufacturing, and logistics. Large-scale purchasing power secures more favorable pricing, while optimized production processes and distribution networks reduce per-unit manufacturing and transportation costs. This cost advantage not only enhances the company's profit margins but also enables it to offer more competitive pricing in the market, solidifying its market leadership."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"聯合利華在全球範圍內建立了廣泛且深入的分銷網絡，尤其是在新興市場，這是一個難以複製的資產。其產品能夠觸及廣大的消費者群體，包括傳統零售渠道和現代零售渠道。這種廣泛的市場滲透能力，結合對當地消費者偏好的深刻理解，構成了其獨特的地理優勢。雖然不是傳統意義上的固定資產，但這種遍佈全球的銷售網絡和市場洞察力，為其品牌產品的銷售提供了堅實的基礎和競爭壁壘。","comment_en":"Unilever has established an extensive and deep distribution network globally, particularly in emerging markets, which is a difficult-to-replicate asset. Its products reach a vast consumer base through both traditional and modern retail channels. This broad market penetration capability, combined with a profound understanding of local consumer preferences, constitutes its unique geographical advantage. While not a traditional fixed asset, this worldwide sales network and market insight provide a solid foundation and competitive barrier for its branded products."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"聯合利華展現出卓越的營運效率，這得益於其精細化的成本控制、優化的供應鏈管理以及持續的流程改進。公司能夠有效地將原材料轉化為高附加值的消費品，並將其高效地送達全球消費者手中。其高 ROE (70.3%) 和 ROA (14.8%) 反映了其優異的資產運用能力和盈利能力。這種持續的營運效率是其能夠在激烈競爭中保持領先地位的關鍵因素之一，體現了其卓越的管理能力。","comment_en":"Unilever demonstrates outstanding operational efficiency, attributed to its meticulous cost control, optimized supply chain management, and continuous process improvement. The company effectively transforms raw materials into high-value consumer goods and efficiently delivers them to consumers worldwide. Its high ROE (70.3%) and ROA (14.8%) reflect its superior asset utilization and profitability. This sustained operational efficiency is a key factor enabling it to maintain a leading position amidst fierce competition, showcasing its excellent management capabilities."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"聯合利華在資本配置方面展現出相對穩健的策略。公司歷史上通過收購擴張，並在適當時機剝離非核心業務，以優化資產組合。儘管其現金流強勁（FCF TTM: $15,590.7M），但其負債水平（$36,644.9M）相對較高，這可能限制了其大規模激進回購或併購的能力。然而，其持續的股息支付和穩定的盈利能力表明，管理層在維持股東回報方面採取了務實的態度，儘管與巴菲特偏好的極致資本效率相比，仍有提升空間。","comment_en":"Unilever exhibits a relatively sound strategy in capital allocation. Historically, the company has expanded through acquisitions and divested non-core businesses at opportune times to optimize its asset portfolio. Although it generates strong cash flow (FCF TTM: $15,590.7M), its debt level ($36,644.9M) is relatively high, which may limit its capacity for large-scale aggressive share buybacks or mergers. However, its consistent dividend payments and stable profitability indicate a pragmatic approach by management to maintain shareholder returns, although there is room for improvement compared to Buffett's preference for ultimate capital efficiency."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"聯合利華通過其強大的品牌矩陣和持續的產品創新，有效地維持了客戶忠誠度。其產品滲透到全球數十億消費者的日常生活中，形成了穩定的消費習慣。儘管單一產品的轉換成本不高，但品牌組合的廣泛性和產品的必需性，使得消費者在整體上對聯合利華的產品線保持高度依賴。持續的廣告投入和市場營銷活動，進一步鞏固了客戶關係，確保了穩定的經常性收入流。","comment_en":"Through its robust brand matrix and continuous product innovation, Unilever effectively maintains customer loyalty. Its products are integrated into the daily lives of billions of consumers globally, fostering stable consumption habits. Although switching costs for individual products are not high, the breadth of its brand portfolio and the essential nature of its products lead consumers to maintain a high overall reliance on Unilever's product lines. Ongoing advertising and marketing efforts further solidify customer relationships, ensuring a stable stream of recurring revenue."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"聯合利華的業務具有顯著的持久性。其產品線涵蓋了人們日常生活中不可或缺的消費品，如食品、飲料和個人護理用品，這些產品的需求相對穩定，不易受經濟週期劇烈波動的影響。即使在經濟下行時期，消費者對這些必需品的開銷也相對剛性。加上其強大的品牌影響力和全球化的佈局，使得聯合利華能夠在長時間內保持其市場地位和盈利能力，體現了其業務的長期韌性。","comment_en":"Unilever's business possesses significant durability. Its product lines encompass essential consumer goods for daily life, such as food, beverages, and personal care items, whose demand is relatively stable and less susceptible to severe economic cycle fluctuations. Even during economic downturns, consumer spending on these necessities remains relatively inelastic. Coupled with its strong brand influence and global presence, this allows Unilever to maintain its market position and profitability over extended periods, demonstrating the long-term resilience of its business."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"聯合利華展現出一個典型的消費品巨頭的護城河特徵，其核心優勢在於強大的品牌定價權（M1）和規模經濟帶來的成本優勢（M5），以及遍佈全球的分銷網絡（M6）。這些構成了其穩固的特許經營權基礎。儘管在專利（M2）和網絡效應（M4）方面壁壘較弱，但其卓越的營運效率（M7）和客戶黏性（M9）彌補了部分不足。整體而言，聯合利華的護城河堅固，屬於一種廣泛的消費品收費橋模式，能夠在長期內為股東創造穩定價值。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Unilever exhibits the moat characteristics of a typical consumer goods giant, with its core strengths lying in strong brand pricing power (M1) and cost advantages derived from economies of scale (M5), complemented by a global distribution network (M6). These constitute the foundation of its solid franchise. Although barriers are weaker in patents (M2) and network effects (M4), its outstanding operational efficiency (M7) and customer stickiness (M9) compensate for some deficiencies. Overall, Unilever's moat is robust, representing a broad consumer goods toll bridge model capable of generating stable value for shareholders over the long term.","evidenceHash":"e71c2ddfa43d1c4e34643bc59a50b5945b5f3221c9104f0bcbb4fa7b6397f48c","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Gemini"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":"staleEvidence","evidenceHash":"e71c2ddfa43d1c4e34643bc59a50b5945b5f3221c9104f0bcbb4fa7b6397f48c","currentEvidenceHash":"84401594c6d444cab8afdc6edbd8e3002c1bdcef9217df6128f6beb487eaec89"},"fScore":{"score":7,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"safe","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"EUR","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-14T07:36:29.226Z","evidenceHash":"01a26c47fc97c2253e74f697c26eed65774f7be3896021f07ee16c8112c121dc","mcapFx":{"asOf":"2026-11-14","from":"USD","to":"EUR","fromUsdPerUnit":1,"toUsdPerUnit":1.1154,"fromObservationDate":"2026-11-14","toObservationDate":"2026-11-06"}},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"EUR","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-14T07:36:29.226Z","evidenceHash":"01a26c47fc97c2253e74f697c26eed65774f7be3896021f07ee16c8112c121dc"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/UL.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/UL.png","website":"https://www.unilever.com","ceo":"Fernando Fernandez","full_time_employees":"96092","description":"Unilever PLC operates as a fast-moving consumer goods company in the Asia Pacific, Africa, the Americas, and Europe. It operates through four segments: Beauty & Wellbeing, Personal Care, Home Care, and Foods. The Beauty & Wellbeing segment offers hair care, such as shampoo, conditioner, and styling; face, hand, and body moisturizer skin care products; and Prestige Beauty and Wellbeing products. The Personal Care segment provides soap and shower skin cleansing products; and deodorant and oral care, including toothpaste, toothbrush, and mouthwash products. The Home Care segment offers washing powders and liquids, and rinse conditioner fabric care products; and a range of home and hygiene cleaning products. The Foods segment provides cooking aids and mini meals comprising soups, bouillons, and seasonings, as well as mayonnaise and ketchup condiments; and Unilever food solutions. The company provides its products under the AXE, Clear, Cif, Closeup, Comfort, Dermalogica, Domestos, Dove, Dove Men+Care, Hellmann's, Horlicks, Knorr, LUX, Lifebuoy, Liquid I.V., Nexxus, Nutrafol, OMO, Pond's, Paula's Choice, Pepsodent, Radiant, Rexona, Sunlight, Sunsilk, Surf, TRESemmé, and Vaseline brand names. Unilever PLC was founded in 1860 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.","description_en":"Unilever PLC operates as a fast-moving consumer goods company in the Asia Pacific, Africa, the Americas, and Europe. It operates through four segments: Beauty & Wellbeing, Personal Care, Home Care, and Foods. The Beauty & Wellbeing segment offers hair care, such as shampoo, conditioner, and styling; face, hand, and body moisturizer skin care products; and Prestige Beauty and Wellbeing products. The Personal Care segment provides soap and shower skin cleansing products; and deodorant and oral care, including toothpaste, toothbrush, and mouthwash products. The Home Care segment offers washing powders and liquids, and rinse conditioner fabric care products; and a range of home and hygiene cleaning products. The Foods segment provides cooking aids and mini meals comprising soups, bouillons, and seasonings, as well as mayonnaise and ketchup condiments; and Unilever food solutions. The company provides its products under the AXE, Clear, Cif, Closeup, Comfort, Dermalogica, Domestos, Dove, Dove Men+Care, Hellmann's, Horlicks, Knorr, LUX, Lifebuoy, Liquid I.V., Nexxus, Nutrafol, OMO, Pond's, Paula's Choice, Pepsodent, Radiant, Rexona, Sunlight, Sunsilk, Surf, TRESemmé, and Vaseline brand names. Unilever PLC was founded in 1860 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.","description_zh":"Unilever PLC（美股代碼：UL）為 Consumer Defensive 領域之重要企業，專注於 Household & Personal Products 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"Unilever House","city":"London","state